	/// Percentage of points achieved within the inspection type measurement test to the number of styles. The number of ordered styles reflect the maximum points which can be achieved. For each issue the possible points will be reduced by 0.5 points for minor issues above the defined tolerances and 1 point for major issues above the defined tolerances. After the reductions the lowest overall score is 0 points.
	measure 'MSMT Test Result' =
			
			DIVIDE ( [MSMT Test Points], [# of styles] )
		formatString: 0.00\ %;-0.00\ %;0.00\ %
		displayFolder: Quality Inspections
		lineageTag: 0ca24cf3-cb75-4f40-b9c9-62b9a982b430

