	/// Percentage of points achieved within the random checks to the number of styles. The number of ordered styles reflect the maximum points which can be achieved. For each failed random check the possible points will be reduced by 1 point. After the reductions the lowest overall score is 0 points.
	measure 'Random Check Result' =
			
			DIVIDE ( [Random Check Points], [# of styles] )
		formatString: 0.00\ %;-0.00\ %;0.00\ %
