	measure 'Description PP Ratio pre calc' =
			
			"The Purchase Price Ratio reflects the percentage of the purchase price pre calculation of a product to the wholesale selling price (WHSSP). The wholesale selling price is calculated dividing the retail price by the retail margin."
		displayFolder: Description
