	measure 'Description Chemical Compliance' =
			
			"Chemical Inventory Compliance against ZDHC MRSL and ZDHC Wastewater Testing​: A) Chemical Inventory:  the chemical inventory is verified against ZDHC MRSL standard based on third party screening tool and test report​​​B) ZDHC Wastewater Testing: perform wastewater testing per ZDHC wastewater guideline (a more stringent industrial standard)​​100% - Demonstrate both A and B (passed)​50% - Demonstrate A and B (failed)​50% - Cannot demonstrate A , only B (passed)​0% - Demonstrate only B (failed)​0% - Demonstrate neither A nor B​."
		displayFolder: Description
		lineageTag: 9235964c-4b38-4d74-b1ac-9f51e70d85a8

